### Protected API server route (middleware rule: messaging/message_type/marketing)
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/messages/marketing
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: alice

{
  "recipient": "customer-42",
  "message": "Sale starts today"
}

### Protected API server route (middleware rule: auth/auth_type/login)
